hadiths[60]{hadithnumber,text}:
"630","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ramzan ka zikr kya aur farmaya ke roza na rakho yahan tak ke chand dekho aur iftar na karo yahan tak ke use dekho, phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to us ke liye andaza karo."
"631","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mahina untees ka hai, to roza na rakho yahan tak ke chand dekho aur iftar na karo yahan tak ke use dekho, phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to us ke liye andaza karo."
"632","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Daili Saur bin Zaid se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ramzan ka zikr kya aur farmaya ke roza na rakho yahan tak ke chand dekho aur iftar na karo yahan tak ke use dekho, phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to ginti tees puri karo."
"633","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke chand Usman bin Affan ke zamane mein shaam ko dekha gaya aur Usman ne iftar na kya yahan tak ke shaam hui aur suraj ghuroob ho gaya. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke jo Ramzan ka chand akele dekhe wo roza rakhe, use iftar na karna chahiye jab ke wo janta hai ke wo din Ramzan mein se hai. Unhon ne kaha ke jo Shawwal ka chand akele dekhe wo iftar na kare kyunke log muttaham hote hain ke un mein se iftar kare jo amanat wala nahi hai, aur wo kehte hain ke jab un par zaahir ho ke hum ne chand dekha hai, aur jo Shawwal ka chand din mein dekhe wo iftar na kare aur apne us din ka roza pura kare, kyunke ye us raat ka chand hai jo aane wali hai. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke jab log Fitr ke din roza rakhein jab ke wo samajhte hon ke ye Ramzan mein se hai, phir un ke paas saboot aae ke Ramzan ka chand un ke roza rakhne se aik din pehle dekha gaya tha aur un ka wo din iktees hai to wo us din iftar karein jis ghadi un ke paas khabar aae, magar wo Eid ki Namaz na padhein agar ye un ke paas suraj dhalne ke baad aae."
"634","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke roza sirf wo rakhe jo Fajr se pehle roze ka irada jama kare."
"635","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dono biwiyon Aaisha aur Hafsa se waisa hi riwayat kya."
"636","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Deenari Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Saidi Sahl bin Saad se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke log musalsal bhalai mein rahein ge jab tak iftar mein jaldi karein."
"637","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Aslami Abdur Rahman bin Harmala se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke log musalsal bhalai mein rahein ge jab tak iftar mein jaldi karein."
"638","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab aur Usman bin Affan Maghrib padhte they jab kaale raat ki taraf dekhte iftar karne se pehle, phir Namaz ke baad iftar karte, aur ye Ramzan mein tha."
"639","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ansari Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Mamar se, unhon ne Aaisha ke ghulam Abu Yunus se, unhon ne Aaisha se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha jab ke wo darwaze par khade they aur main sun rahi thi, ya Rasulullah main junbi subah karta hun jab ke main roza rakhna chahta hun. To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main bhi junbi subah karta hun jab ke main roza rakhna chahta hun, phir ghusl karta hun aur roza rakhta hun. To us shakhs ne Aap se kaha ke ya Rasulullah Aap hum jaisey nahi hain, Allah ne Aap ke agle aur pichhle gunah bakhsh diye hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghazabnak hue aur farmaya ke Allah ki qasam main umeed rakhta hun ke main tum mein se Allah se zyada darne wala hun aur is se zyada janne wala hun jis se bachta hun."
"640","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saeed ke bete Abd Rabbihi se, unhon ne Haris bin Hisham ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Bakr se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dono biwiyon Aaisha aur Umm Salma se riwayat kya ke dono ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramzan mein ehtelam ke baghair jima se junbi subah karte phir roza rakhte."
"641","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Haris bin Hisham ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Bakr ke ghulam Sumay se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Haris bin Hisham ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Bakr ko kehte suna ke main aur mere walid Marwan bin Hakam ke paas they, jab ke wo Madina ke ameer they, to unhein bataya gaya ke Abu Huraira kehte hain ke jo junbi subah kare us din iftar kare. To Marwan ne kaha ke main tumhein qasam deta hun aey Abdur Rahman ke tum Ummul Momineen Aaisha aur Umm Salma ke paas zaroor jao aur un dono se is bare mein sawal karo, to Abdur Rahman gae aur main un ke sath gaya yahan tak ke hum Aaisha ke paas dakhil hue aur unhein salam kya, phir kaha ke ya Ummul Momineen hum Marwan bin Hakam ke paas they to unhein bataya gaya ke Abu Huraira kehte hain ke jo junbi subah kare us din iftar kare. Aaisha ne kaha ke jaisa Abu Huraira ne kaha waisa nahi hai, aey Abdur Rahman kya tum us se munh pherte ho jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) karte they, to Abdur Rahman ne kaha ke nahi Allah ki qasam. Aaisha ne kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par gawahi deti hun ke Aap ehtelam ke baghair jima se junbi subah karte phir us din roza rakhte. Unhon ne kaha ke phir hum nikle yahan tak ke Umm Salma ke paas dakhil hue aur un se is bare mein sawal kya to unhon ne waisa hi kaha jaisa Aaisha ne kaha tha. Unhon ne kaha ke phir hum nikle yahan tak ke Marwan bin Hakam ke paas aae aur Abdur Rahman ne unhein wo bataya jo dono ne kaha tha, to Marwan ne kaha ke main tumhein qasam deta hun aey Abu Muhammad ke tum meri sawari par zaroor sawaar ho, kyunke wo darwaze par hai, aur Abu Huraira ke paas zaroor jao kyunke wo Aqiq mein apni zameen mein hain, aur unhein ye khabar do. To Abdur Rahman sawaar hue aur main un ke sath sawaar hua yahan tak ke hum Abu Huraira ke paas aae, phir Abdur Rahman ne un se aik ghadi baat ki phir unhein ye bataya, to Abu Huraira ne un se kaha ke mujhe is ka koi ilm nahi, mujhe sirf aik khabar dene wale ne khabar di thi."
"642","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke ghulam Sumay se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dono biwiyon Aaisha aur Umm Salma se riwayat kya ke dono ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ehtelam ke baghair jima se junbi subah karte phir roza rakhte."
"643","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs ne Ramzan mein roze se hote hue apni biwi ko bosa diya aur is se sakht gham paya, phir apni biwi ko bheja ke us ke liye is bare mein sawal kare, to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ke paas dakhil hui aur unhein ye bataya, to Umm Salma ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bosa dete jab ke Aap roze se hote. Phir wo lauti aur apne khawind ko ye khabar di to is ne us ke shar mein izafa kya aur kaha ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaisey nahi hain, Allah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye jo chahe halal karta hai. Phir us ki biwi Umm Salma ke paas lauti aur un ke paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is aurat ko kya hai. To Umm Salma ne Aap ko khabar di, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum ne use khabar na di ke main aisa karta hun. To unhon ne kaha ke maine use khabar di thi, phir wo apne khawind ke paas gai aur use khabar di to is ne us ke shar mein izafa kya aur kaha ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaisey nahi hain, Allah apne Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye jo chahe halal karta hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghazabnak hue aur farmaya ke Allah ki qasam main tum mein se Allah se zyada darne wala hun aur us ki hadon ko zyada janne wala hun."
"644","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ummul Momineen Aaisha, Allah un se raazi ho, se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni baaz biwiyon ko bosa dete jab ke Aap roze se hote. Phir hansin."
"645","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ki biwi Nufail ke bete Zaid ki beti Atika Umar bin Khattab ke sar ko bosa deti jab ke wo roze se hote aur wo unhein mana na karte."
"646","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se riwayat kya ke Talha ki beti Aaisha ne unhein khabar di ke wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ke paas thin aur un ke paas un ke khawind dakhil hue jo Abu Bakr Siddiq ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abdullah they, jab ke wo roze se they, to Aaisha ne un se kaha ke tumhein kya rokta hai ke apne ghar walon se qareeb ho aur use bosa do aur us se khelo, to unhon ne kaha ke main use bosa dun jab ke main roze se hun, unhon ne kaha ke haan."
"647","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Abu Huraira aur Saad bin Abi Waqqas roze wale ke liye bose mein rukhsat dete they."
"648","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha jab zikr karti ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bosa dete jab ke Aap roze se hote to kehti ke tum mein se kaun apne aap par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada qaabu rakhta hai."
"649","Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke Hisham bin Urwa ne kaha ke Zubair ke bete Urwa ne kaha ke maine roze wale ke liye bosa bhalai ki taraf bulate na dekha."
"650","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Abbas se roze wale ke bose ke bare mein sawal kya gaya to budhe ke liye is mein rukhsat di aur jawan ke liye ise makrooh samjha."
"651","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar roze wale ke liye bose aur lipatne se mana karte they."
"652","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Utba bin Masud ke bete Ubaidullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fatah ke saal Ramzan mein Makka ki taraf nikle aur Kadeed pahunchne tak roza rakha phir iftar kya, to logon ne iftar kya, aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke muamle mein se nae se nae ko lete they."
"653","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ke ghulam Sumay se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se baaz se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Fatah ke saal apne safar mein logon ko iftar ka hukm diya aur farmaya ke apne dushman ke liye taqat lo. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne roza rakha. Abu Bakr ne kaha ke mujhe jis ne bayan kya us ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Araj mein dekha ke Aap apne sar par piyas ya garmi se pani daal rahe they, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya ke ya Rasulullah logon mein se aik giroh ne roza rakha hai jab Aap ne roza rakha. Unhon ne kaha ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Kadeed mein they to pyala mangwaya aur piya, to logon ne iftar kya."
"654","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Taweel Humaid se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Ramzan mein safar kya aur roze wale ne iftar wale par aur na iftar wale ne roze wale par aib lagaya."
"655","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Aslami Hamza bin Amr ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke ya Rasulullah main roza rakhne wala shakhs hun, to kya main safar mein roza rakhun, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke agar chaho to roza rakho aur agar chaho to iftar karo."
"656","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar safar mein roza na rakhte they."
"657","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo Ramzan mein safar karte aur hum un ke sath safar karte, to Urwa roza rakhte aur hum iftar karte, to wo humein roze ka hukm na dete."
"658","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab jab Ramzan mein safar mein hote aur jante ke wo apne pehle din se Madina dakhil hone wale hain to dakhil hote jab ke wo roze se hote. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke jo safar mein ho aur jane ke wo apne pehle din se apne ghar walon par dakhil hone wala hai aur us ke liye Fajr taloo ho dakhil hone se pehle to wo dakhil ho jab ke wo roze se ho. Malik ne kaha ke jab Ramzan mein nikalna chahe aur us ke liye Fajr taloo ho jab ke wo nikalne se pehle apni zameen mein hai to wo us din roza rakhe. Malik ne us shakhs ke bare mein kaha jo apne safar se aae jab ke wo iftar kiye hue ho aur us ki biwi iftar kiye hue ho jab Ramzan mein apne haiz se paak hui ho ke us ke khawind ke liye hai ke us se sohbat kare agar chahe."
"659","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Humaid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs ne Ramzan mein iftar kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use hukm diya ke gardan azaad karke ya do mahine lagatar roze rakh kar ya saath miskeenon ko khana khila kar kaffara de. To us ne kaha ke main taqat nahi rakhta. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas khajoor ka tokra laya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya ke ye lo aur is se sadqa karo. To us ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah mujh se zyada koi mohtaaj nahi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hanse yahan tak ke Aap ki daadhein zaahir huin, phir farmaya ke use khao."
"660","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Khurasani Abdullah ke bete Ata se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke aik dehati Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya jo apni gardan peet-ta aur apne baal nochta tha aur kehta tha ke door wala halaak hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke ye kya hai. To us ne kaha ke maine apne ghar walon ko paya jab ke main Ramzan mein roze se tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke kya tum gardan azaad karne ki taqat rakhte ho. To us ne kaha ke nahi. To farmaya ke kya tum oont hadiya karne ki taqat rakhte ho. Us ne kaha ke nahi. Aap ne farmaya ke baith jao. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas khajoor ka tokra laya gaya to farmaya ke ye lo aur is se sadqa karo. To us ne kaha ke mujh se zyada koi mohtaaj nahi. To farmaya ke use khao aur jo tum ne paya us ki jagah aik din roza rakho. Malik ne kaha ke Ata ne kaha ke maine Saeed bin Musayyab se sawal kya ke us tokre mein khajoor kitni thi, to unhon ne kaha ke pandrah saa se bees ke darmiyan."
"661","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo roze se hote hue pachhne lagwate they, unhon ne kaha ke phir is ke baad ye chhor diya aur jab roza rakhte to pachhne na lagwate yahan tak ke iftar karte."
"662","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Saad bin Abi Waqqas aur Abdullah bin Umar pachhne lagwate they jab ke wo roze se hote."
"663","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo pachhne lagwate they jab ke wo roze se hote phir iftar na karte. Unhon ne kaha ke maine unhein kabhi pachhne lagwate na dekha magar jab ke wo roze se hote. Malik ne kaha ke roze wale ke liye pachhne lagwana makrooh nahi magar is khauf se ke kamzor ho jaye, aur agar ye na hota to makrooh na hota, aur agar shakhs Ramzan mein pachhne lagwae phir iftar karne se mehfooz rahe to main us par koi cheez nahi samajhta aur use us din ki qaza ka hukm na dun jis mein us ne pachhne lagwaya, kyunke pachhne lagwana roze wale ke liye sirf roze mein dhoke ki jagah se makrooh hai, phir jo pachhne lagwae aur iftar karne se mehfooz rahe yahan tak ke shaam kare to main us par koi cheez nahi samajhta aur us par us din ki qaza nahi."
"664","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Ashura ka din aisa din tha jis ka Quraysh jahiliyat mein roza rakhte they, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jahiliyat mein use roza rakhte they, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina aae to use roza rakha aur us ke roze ka hukm diya, phir jab Ramzan farz hua to ye farz tha aur Ashura ka din chhor diya gaya, phir jo chahe use roza rakhe aur jo chahe chhor de."
"665","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Humaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan ko suna Ashura ke din jis saal Hajj kya jab ke wo mimbar par they, kehte ke aey Madina walon tumhare ulema kahan hain, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is din ke liye kehte suna ke ye Ashura ka din hai aur tum par us ka roza nahi likha gaya, aur main roze se hun, phir jo chahe roza rakhe aur jo chahe iftar kare."
"666","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab ne Hisham ke bete Haris ki taraf bheja ke kal Ashura ka din hai to roza rakho aur apne ghar walon ko hukm do ke roza rakhein."
"667","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hibban ke bete Muhammad bin Yahya se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do din ke roze se mana kya, Fitr ke din aur Azha ke din."
"668","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne ahl-e-ilm ko kehte suna ke tamam umr roza rakhne mein koi harj nahi jab un dinon mein iftar kare jin ke roze se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya hai, jo Mina ke din aur Azha ka din aur Fitr ka din hain hamari khabar mein. Unhon ne kaha ke ye jo maine suna hai us mein sab se pasandida hai."
"669","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Wisal se mana kya, to unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah Aap to Wisal karte hain, to Aap ne farmaya ke main tum jaisa nahi hun, mujhe khilaya aur pilaya jata hai."
"670","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Wisal se bacho, Wisal se bacho. Unhon ne kaha ke Aap to Wisal karte hain ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke main tum jaisa nahi hun, main raat guzarta hun jab ke mera Rab mujhe khilata aur pilata hai."
"671","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Abbas se roze wale ke bose ke bare mein sawal kya gaya to unhon ne budhe ke liye is mein rukhsat di aur jawan ke liye ise makrooh samjha."
"672","Malik ne kaha ke mujhe Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se waisa hi khabar pahunchi. Malik ne kaha ke jo mare jab ke us par gardan ki nazr ho jise wo azaad kare ya roza ya sadqa ya oont, phir wasiyat kare ke us ke maal mein se us ki taraf se ye pura kya jaye to sadqa aur oont us ke teesre hisse mein hain, aur ye us ke siwa wasiyaton par muqaddam hai magar jo is jaisa ho, aur ye is liye ke nazron aur is ke siwa mein se jo us par wajib hai wo us jaisa nahi jo nafl ke sath nafl karta hai jo wajib nahi, wo ise khaas teesre hisse mein rakhta hai apne asal maal mein nahi, kyunke agar us ke liye ye us ke asal maal mein jaiz hota to faut hone wala is jaisi wajib cheezon mein se us jaisi ko moakhkhar karta yahan tak ke jab us ke paas maut aati aur maal us ke warison ka ho jata to is jaisi cheezon ka naam leta jin ka us se koi taqaza karne wala taqaza na karta tha, phir agar ye us ke liye jaiz hota to ye cheezein moakhkhar karta yahan tak ke jab maut ke paas hota to in ka naam leta, aur ho sakta hai ke apne tamam maal ko gher le, to ye us ke liye nahi hai."
"673","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar se sawal kya jata tha ke kya koi kisi ki taraf se roza rakhta hai ya koi kisi ki taraf se Namaz padhta hai, to kehte ke koi kisi ki taraf se roza nahi rakhta aur na koi kisi ki taraf se Namaz padhta hai."
"674","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Aslam ke bete Khalid ke bhai Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Ramzan mein aik din badalon wale din mein iftar kya aur dekha ke shaam ho gai hai aur suraj ghuroob ho gaya hai. Phir un ke paas aik shakhs aaya aur kaha ke ya Ameerul Momineen suraj nikal aaya hai. To Umar ne kaha ke muamla aasan hai aur hum ne ijtihad kya. Malik ne kaha ke un ke qaul se ke muamla aasan hai hamare khayal mein qaza muraad hai, aur Allah behtar janta hai, aur us ki moanat ka halka aur aasan hona, kehte hain ke hum us ki jagah aik din roza rakhte hain."
"675","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke Ramzan ki qaza lagatar roza rakhe jo bimari ya safar mein iftar kare."
"676","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Abbas aur Abu Huraira ne Ramzan ki qaza mein ikhtilaf kya, to un mein se aik ne kaha ke is mein farq kare. Aur dusre ne kaha ke is mein farq na kare. Main nahi janta in dono mein se kis ne kaha ke is mein farq kare."
"677","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jo roze se hote hue qai kare us par qaza hai, aur jis par qai ghalib aa jaye us par qaza nahi."
"678","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko Ramzan ki qaza ke bare mein sawal karte suna to Saeed ne kaha ke mere nazdeek pasand hai ke Ramzan ki qaza mein farq na kare aur lagatar rakhe. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke jo Ramzan ki qaza mein farq kare us par dobara nahi hai, aur ye us ki taraf se kaafi hai, aur mere nazdeek pasand ye hai ke lagatar rakhe. Malik ne kaha ke jo Ramzan mein bhool ya nasyaan se khae ya piye ya jo us par wajib roze mein se ho us par us ki jagah aik din ki qaza hai."
"679","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Humaid bin Qais se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha ke main Mujahid ke sath tha jab ke wo Baitullah ka tawaf kar rahe they, to un ke paas aik insan aaya aur un se kaffare ke dinon ke roze ke bare mein sawal kya ke kya lagatar hon ya unhein kaate, Humaid ne kaha ke maine un se kaha ke haan, use kaate agar chahe. Mujahid ne kaha ke use na kaate, kyunke ye Ubay bin Kaab ki qiraat mein teen din lagatar hain. Malik ne kaha ke mere nazdeek pasand hai ke jo Allah ne Quran mein naam liya wo lagatar roza rakha jaye. Aur Malik se us aurat ke bare mein sawal kya gaya jo Ramzan mein roze se subah kare aur taaza khoon ka dhakka gair haiz ke waqt mein aae phir intezar kare yahan tak ke shaam ho ke us jaisa dekhe aur koi cheez na dekhe, phir dusre din subah kare aur dusra dhakka aae jo pehle se kam ho, phir ye us se us ke haiz se dinon pehle kat jaye, to Malik se sawal kya gaya ke wo apne roze aur apni Namaz mein kya kare, Malik ne kaha ke ye khoon haiz mein se hai, phir jab use dekhe to iftar kare aur jo iftar kya us ki qaza kare, phir jab us se khoon chala jaye to ghusl kare aur roza rakhe. Aur us ke bare mein sawal kya gaya jo Ramzan ke aakhri din mein musalman ho ke kya us par tamam Ramzan ki qaza hai ya us par us din ki qaza wajib hai jis mein wo musalman hua, to unhon ne kaha ke us par jo guzra us ki qaza nahi, wo sirf aane wale mein roza nae sire se rakhe, aur mere nazdeek pasand hai ke us din ki qaza kare jis mein wo musalman hua."
"680","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dono biwiyon Aaisha aur Hafsa ne nafl mein roze se subah ki aur unhein khana hadiya kya gaya to us par iftar kya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ke paas dakhil hue. Aaisha ne kaha ke Hafsa ne kaha aur mujh se baat mein pehel ki, jab ke wo apne walid ki beti thin, ya Rasulullah main ne aur Aaisha ne nafl mein roze se subah ki aur humein khana hadiya kya gaya to hum ne us par iftar kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us ki jagah dusre din qaza karo."
"681","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Anas bin Malik budhe ho gae yahan tak ke roza rakhne ki taqat na rakhte they aur fidya dete they. Malik ne kaha ke main ye wajib nahi samajhta, aur mere nazdeek pasand hai ke ye kare jab is par qadir ho, phir jo fidya de wo har din ki jagah Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mudd se aik mudd khilaye."
"682","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar se hamila aurat ke bare mein sawal kya gaya jab wo apne bache par dare aur us par roza sakht ho, unhon ne kaha ke iftar kare aur har din ki jagah aik miskeen ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mudd se gehu ka aik mudd khilaye. Malik ne kaha ke ahl-e-ilm us par qaza dekhte hain jaisa Allah Azza wa Jal ne farmaya ke phir tum mein se jo beemar ho ya safar par ho to dusre dinon se ginti, aur usey amraaz mein se marz dekhte hain apne bache par khauf ke sath."
"683","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Qasim ke bete Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jis par Ramzan ki qaza ho aur use qaza na kare jab ke wo us ke roze par qadir ho yahan tak ke dusra Ramzan aa jaye to wo har din ki jagah aik miskeen ko gehu ka aik mudd khilaye aur us ke sath qaza bhi. Aur mujhe Malik se Saeed bin Jubair se waisa hi khabar pahunchi."
"684","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Saad bin Abi Waqqas aur Abdullah bin Umar pachhne lagwate they jab ke wo roze se hote."
"685","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ko kehte suna ke mere upar Ramzan mein se roza hota tha aur main use roza na rakh sakti thi yahan tak ke Shaban aata."
"686","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) roza rakhte yahan tak ke hum kehte ke iftar na karein ge, aur iftar karte yahan tak ke hum kehte ke roza na rakhein ge, aur maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi mahine ka pura roza rakhte na dekha magar Ramzan, aur maine Aap ko mahine mein Shaban se zyada roza rakhte na dekha."
"687","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke roza dhaal hai, phir jab tum mein se koi roze se ho to fahash goi na kare aur na jahalat kare, phir agar koi shakhs us se lade ya use gaali de to kahe ke main roze se hun, main roze se hun."
"688","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, roze wale ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushboo se zyada pakeeza hai, wo sirf meri wajah se apni khwahish aur apna khana aur apna peena chhorta hai, to roza mere liye hai aur main is ka badla deta hun, har neki dus guna se saat sau guna tak magar roza, to ye mere liye hai aur main is ka badla deta hun."
"689","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne apne chacha Abu Suhail bin Malik se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jab Ramzan dakhil hota hai to Jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain aur aag ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain aur shayateen jakad diye jate hain."
